{
    "title": "Hipcamp: Camping, RVs & Cabins",
    "description": "The best and most comprehensive App for unique outdoor stays in the U.S., Canada, and Australia. We work with landowners so you can discover and book tent camping, RV parks, cabin rentals, treehouses, and glamping\u2014everywhere from national parks to blueberry farms.\r\n\r\nFind one-of-a-kind campsites away from the crowds, see real-time availability for national park camping, and trust community photos and reviews with the Hipcamp app.\r\n\r\n\u2605 Featured in the New York Times, USA Today, Fast Company, the New Yorker, the Washington Post, Conde Nast Traveler, Lonely Planet \u2605\r\n\r\nBOOK TENT SITES, RV SITES, CABINS & GLAMPING \u26fa\r\n\u2022 Find last-minute campsites and RV sites near you or plan ahead to book the best campgrounds and cabins with the app.\r\n\u2022 See real-time availability to go camping in top national parks like Yosemite, Zion, the Great Smoky Mountains, and Yellowstone, as well as destinations from Hawaii to the Hudson Valley.\r\n\u2022 Campground locator: Filter by price, location, group size, pet-friendliness, bathrooms, showers, campfires, wifi, and more.\r\n\r\nUNIQUE CAMPING & GLAMPING EXPERIENCES \ud83d\udef6\r\n\u2022 By partnering with private landowners, Hipcamp showcases hidden, off-the-beaten-path outdoor destinations you can\u2019t find anywhere else.\r\n\u2022 Plan a hiking trip, a family camping vacation, a romantic glamping getaway, or a business retreat.\r\n\u2022 Stay the night at private vineyards, animal sanctuaries, country farms, secluded lakes, luxury yurts, and rustic beachside cabins.\r\n\u2022 Connect with good-natured landowners offering homemade goods, rentals, and outdoor experiences (yoga classes, foraging tours, etc).\r\n\r\nKEEP THINGS SIMPLE ON THE ROAD \ud83d\ude99\r\n\u2022 Access campground booking information such as directions and check-in details offline.\r\n\u2022 Invite travel companions and share camping trip details with invited guests.\r\n\u2022 Use the map view to discover places to stay on your road trip.\r\n\r\nEnjoying the app? Please leave a five-star review!\r\n\r\nQuestions? Get in touch at https://hipca.mp/support. We\u2019d love to hear from you.",
    "descriptionHTML": "The best and most comprehensive App for unique outdoor stays in the U.S., Canada, and Australia. We work with landowners so you can discover and book tent camping, RV parks, cabin rentals, treehouses, and glamping\u2014everywhere from national parks to blueberry farms.<br><br>Find one-of-a-kind campsites away from the crowds, see real-time availability for national park camping, and trust community photos and reviews with the Hipcamp app.<br><br>\u2605 Featured in the New York Times, USA Today, Fast Company, the New Yorker, the Washington Post, Conde Nast Traveler, Lonely Planet \u2605<br><br>BOOK TENT SITES, RV SITES, CABINS &amp; GLAMPING \u26fa<br>\u2022 Find last-minute campsites and RV sites near you or plan ahead to book the best campgrounds and cabins with the app.<br>\u2022 See real-time availability to go camping in top national parks like Yosemite, Zion, the Great Smoky Mountains, and Yellowstone, as well as destinations from Hawaii to the Hudson Valley.<br>\u2022 Campground locator: Filter by price, location, group size, pet-friendliness, bathrooms, showers, campfires, wifi, and more.<br><br>UNIQUE CAMPING &amp; GLAMPING EXPERIENCES \ud83d\udef6<br>\u2022 By partnering with private landowners, Hipcamp showcases hidden, off-the-beaten-path outdoor destinations you can\u2019t find anywhere else.<br>\u2022 Plan a hiking trip, a family camping vacation, a romantic glamping getaway, or a business retreat.<br>\u2022 Stay the night at private vineyards, animal sanctuaries, country farms, secluded lakes, luxury yurts, and rustic beachside cabins.<br>\u2022 Connect with good-natured landowners offering homemade goods, rentals, and outdoor experiences (yoga classes, foraging tours, etc).<br><br>KEEP THINGS SIMPLE ON THE ROAD \ud83d\ude99<br>\u2022 Access campground booking information such as directions and check-in details offline.<br>\u2022 Invite travel companions and share camping trip details with invited guests.<br>\u2022 Use the map view to discover places to stay on your road trip.<br><br>Enjoying the app? Please leave a five-star review!<br><br>Questions? Get in touch at https://hipca.mp/support. We\u2019d love to hear from you.",
